  "selfReview": "The meter fills (taps, rising pizzicato and air), then the motif's tail A, Ab, F falls with band stabs and a crash. Critic round 1 (2026-11-24): the synth brass came down to -9 dB and VSCO 2 violas (fast bowing) double the stabs at -6 dB; on the landing the brass now sits 16.8 dB under the mix (8.4 before), the violas carry the stab (10 dB under the mix, 5.9 dB on the phone model) and the kick is 13.1 dB under (4.6 before). The 1.2 s fill may feel rushed at 100 BPM; that needs an ear.",
